stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Red

    Red --> Green: clap detected<br/>(semSoundLED)
    Green --> Red: 1s timeout<br/>(led_turn_off_time)

    note right of Red
        State: Idle
        Color: RED
        Pin 25: HIGH
        Pin 26: LOW
        Pin 27: LOW
    end note

    note right of Green
        State: Active
        Color: GREEN
        Pin 25: LOW
        Pin 26: HIGH
        Pin 27: LOW
        Duration: 1s
    end note